# Mi Sound rounded outline icons

All preset artwork uses a 24-unit grid, 2-unit strokes, rounded ends and joins, with no solid silhouette fill. Dynamic theme colors and the selected circle come from the shared choice indicator.

Lucide source revision `70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934`; SVG geometry is preserved, with equivalent paths for circle/line/rounded-rectangle primitives. See [ISC/Feather license and attribution](lucide-LICENSE.txt).

- [guitar](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/guitar.svg)
- [disc-3](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/disc-3.svg)
- [mic-vocal](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/mic-vocal.svg)
- [piano](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/piano.svg)
- [hand-metal](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/hand-metal.svg)
- [audio-lines](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/audio-lines.svg)
- [mic](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/mic.svg)
- [scale](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/scale.svg)
- [sliders-vertical](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/sliders-vertical.svg)

Custom Apache-2.0 artwork: electric guitar (Rock), saxophone (Jazz), harmonica (Blues), disco ball (Dance), and rounded seven-band EQ spectra. These share the library grid and stroke rules. Classical uses piano; Metal uses the metal-hand gesture; Country uses acoustic guitar. Effect spectra depict actual saved gains from bass on the left to treble on the right. Audio values and callbacks are unchanged.

The Mi Sound screen waveform mark is app-authored rounded vector artwork (Apache-2.0), not an official Xiaomi trademark asset.
